      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Derelict Cottage on c. 10 Acres for Sale by Private Treaty.\r\n\r\nWe are delighted to bring this spectacular plot of land to the market together with derelict cottage and mobile home.\r\n\r\nThe property commands outstanding views over Ballisodare Bay and Knocknarea.\r\n\r\nThis is a beautiful parcel of land which is located along the public roadway c. 500 metres off the N59 and c. 7.5 kms from Balllisodare.\r\n\r\nThis is a wonderful opportunity to acquire a parcel of good land with potential, close to the coast and Sligo Town.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSet in beautiful countryside and on 10 acres of good pasture land.\r\n\r\nTitle:    Freehold - Folio SL13553\r\n\r\nArea:   c.4.07 ha/10 Acres."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
